{"version":1,"content":"<p>84歲盧海鵬近年因健康問題淡出幕前，生活低調的他近日現身，激罕與兒子同框。</p><p>原來盧海鵬兒子即將離港回加拿大，當日眾人正正為他餞行，場面溫馨。</p><p>見盧海鵬雖然滿頭白髮，但面色紅潤、精神奕奕，絲毫不見病容，狀態非常不錯。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:18:28.233261+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:01:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:11:45.428984+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:11:45.428984+00:00","content_hash":"e6b6ce565691a66126f10292751f16720e9e11a022dac0ab98cda28850c10929","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}